# The worker image is built from the repo root (packages/worker/Dockerfile), so
# that build can take @wnk/shared. Everything is out unless named here; what
# is named is also what the CDK asset hash covers, so only these files rebuild
# the image.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!packages/shared/package.json
!packages/shared/src
!packages/worker/package.json
!packages/worker/tsconfig.json
!packages/worker/src
!packages/worker/scripts
!packages/worker/Dockerfile
